            "value": "Page titles and your avatar stay pinned at the top while content scrolls underneath. The Following avatar strip and the Live Recommended/Following switcher stay pinned with the title."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "各页面的标题和头像随内容一起滚走。关注页的头像条、直播页的推荐/关注切换器也随标题一起滚走；搜索页上滑时只收起标题，搜索框留在顶部。": {
