            "value": "Enter a keyword to search"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "边距按看得见的控件计算，调到 0 时控件贴着屏幕边缘。左右边距默认跟随系统横屏安全区，正好避开屏幕圆角和灵动岛；调得太小时控件会伸进四角的圆弧里。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Margins are measured to the visible controls; at 0 they touch the screen edge. Side margins follow the system's landscape safe area by default, clearing the rounded corners and Dynamic Island. If set too small, controls extend into the corners."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "边距按看得见的控件计算，调到 0 时控件贴着画面边缘。": {
